nswer.\n- code: BRAIN_TEMPORAL_UNCERTAIN\n- message: Relevant context has no verified claim for the requested time or has unspecified temporal state: entities/anvil-primitives.md, entities/continuity.md, entities/go.md (+31 more)\n- recovery: Use explicit temporal or source follow-up before claiming current or dated applicability; do not invent missing times.\n\n### Recall Route\n\n- current_project: unknown_project\n- kernel_pages: none\n- evidence_pages: `work-history/brain-context-runtime.md`, `work-history/manifest-production-shaping.md`, `work-history/global-collaboration-instruction-reconciliation.md`\n- temporal_query: {\"view\":\"current\",\"request_time\":\"2026-09-06T12:35:21.695000Z\",\"world_at\":\"2026-09-06T12:35:21.695000Z\",\"known_at\":\"2026-09-06T12:35:21.695000Z\"}\n",
