ats conflicting notes as unknown, and reads current details separately from the Git cache. All ten known Brain additions, including the three already Git-proved W2.6 children, now show the same marker; unrelated unknowns stay unknown. The real-graph regression and 1440x1000/430x932 browser checks pass without changing execution facts, selection or phase-switch geometry. No schema field, separate origin store or baseline file was added. The earlier Git-only completion claim was too narrow.\"},\"predicate\":\"manifest:task_creation_marker\",\"recorded_at\":\"2026-09-06T08:17:00Z\",\"revision_id\":\"temporal-revision:sha256:74a520bbca833ff2e12648f64de150d0734ebc4687af3d468c618ab39387f20d\",\"status\":\"settled\",\"steward_evidence_refs\":[\"sources/manifest-known-creation-history-correction-2026-09-06.md\"],\"subject\":{\"kind\":\"resolved_page\",\"page\":\"entities/manifest.md\"},\"view\":\"current\",\"world_validity\":{\"from\":{\"kind\":\"known\",\"value\":\"2026-09-06\"},\"to\":{\"kind\":\"open\"}}}\n\n- evidence_id: `temporal:entities/manifest.md#temporal-revision:sha256:74a520bbca833ff2e12648f64de150d0734ebc4687af3d468c618ab39387f20d`\n- roles: `answer`, `current_claim`, `authority`\n\n#### `self-model/working-with-vik-situational-rules.md`\n\n{\"authority\":\"target_wiki_steward\",\"claim_key\":\"temporal-claim:sha256:2a85122e8912f86d7b4c4951f59676e405a177f1202a9667cc481e4a6084a52f\",\"decision\":\"accept\",\"object\":{\"datatype\":\"type:text\",\"kind\":\"literal\",\"value\":\"Before launching a fresh session to verify a hook change, identify the hook lifecycle and use the smallest proof that satisfies the acceptance criterion. UserPromptSubmit changes apply on the next prompt in the current session; reserve fresh sessions for behavior that genuinely requires clean-session isolation.\"},\"predicate\":\"verification:uses_smallest_lifecycle_aware_proof\",\"recorded_at\":\"2026-08-20T04:05:02Z\",\"revision_id\":\"temporal-revision:sha256:1e7865ff69a5350c98fb014bca