"open\"}}}\n\n- evidence_id: `temporal:entities/llm-wiki.md#temporal-revision:sha256:2fdab0626917e42444e7d2ae5b4e85e3ae112e774af4393137929e1360246cc0`\n- roles: `answer`, `lineage`, `authority`\n\n#### `entities/llm-wiki.md`\n\n{\"authority\":\"target_wiki_steward\",\"claim_key\":\"temporal-claim:sha256:2578bcc828aee3f0a7a5cd857fee4b52448c7ea0e736f5979cad25fb864a0eee\",\"decision\":\"accept\",\"object\":{\"datatype\":\"type:text\",\"kind\":\"literal\",\"value\":\"The compiler checks claim and source relevance separately from role coverage and temporal eligibility; W2.3 is installed and verified, while MCP no-evidence acceptance, resident connection reload, and full temporal ordinary-recall integration remain pending.\"},\"predicate\":\"compiler:question_relevance\",\"recorded_at\":\"2026-09-05T13:13:12Z\",\"revision_id\":\"temporal-revision:sha256:857eb29f0dfc16110ceb3cdd3c2d81b0828a4adbaab912ddc5331e8dd50a1997\",\"status\":\"settled\",\"steward_evidence_refs\":[\"sources/brain-question-relevance-repair-2026-09-05.md\"],\"subject\":{\"kind\":\"resolved_page\",\"page\":\"entities/llm-wiki.md\"},\"view\":\"lineage\",\"world_validity\":{\"from\":{\"kind\":\"known\",\"value\":\"2026-09-05\"},\"to\":{\"kind\":\"open\"}}}\n\n- evidence_id: `temporal:entities/llm-wiki.md#temporal-revision:sha256:857eb29f0dfc16110ceb3cdd3c2d81b0828a4adbaab912ddc5331e8dd50a1997`\n- roles: `answer`, `lineage`, `authority`\n\n#### `entities/llm-wiki.md`\n\n{\"authority\":\"target_wiki_steward\",\"claim_key\":\"temporal-claim:sha256:0853c20e1b809abf0204ac39ab8554f1fb13635388042d45fa495d0dcd9a81c3\",\"decision\":\"supersede\",\"object\":{\"datatype\":\"type:text\",\"kind\":\"literal\",\"value\":\"Vik requested commits before further implementation on 6 September 2026. Compiler repair and its earlier relevance prerequisite are committed in llm-wiki cf0d351; Brain Objective and evidence are committed in Anvil 909a4c1. W2.6 remains incomplete after failed ordinary delivery acceptance. Live graph in